<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Ayṯ-Galaṭya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayṯ-Galaṭya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Galaṭya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Galaṭya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus, nec ḏ ijjen n arrasul maci s yiwḏan niɣ s ȓxaḍar n bnaḏem; Lla, nec ḏ arrasul s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ u ƹaweḏ s Arebbi Babaṯneɣ iy d isekkaren Ƹisa zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" /><char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> nec ḏ marra ayṯma iǧan akiḏi ɣar ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin iǧan ḏi jwayeh n Galaṭya.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Lmasiḥ iṣeddeq ixef nnes x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nneɣ s ȓxaḍar n Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḥima aḏaneɣ isenjem zi zman-a aƹeffan iy ḏi neǧa. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i netta i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nec setƹejjibeɣ ḏaywem, ḏeɣya ṯsemḥem ḏi Arebbi iy ḏawem d iȓaɣan s arḍa n Lmasiḥ ṯḏeffarem can n Lʼinjil nneɣni mzuwwar! <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Walakin war ḏinni bu can n Lʼinjil nneɣni. Ɣir ḏinni can yiwḏan iy kenniw isxerwaḍen rezzun aḏ sƹewwjen Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Walakin neccin meȓa nbeccar-ikenniw niɣ ibeccar-ikenniw can n lmalak zeg ujenna s can n Lʼinjil nneɣni maci s wenni iy zi kenniw nbeccar zi qbeȓ, ataf wenni iy kenniw ɣa ibeccaren aḏ itwanƹeȓ! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Mammec ḏawem nenna zi qbeȓ aḏawem ṯ ƹawḏeɣ nec ȓexxu: Meȓa can yijjen ibeccar-ikenniw s can n Lʼinjil nneɣni maci ḏ wenni iy tuɣa ṯqebȓem, ataf aḏ itwanƹeȓ!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Cuf, nec ma rezzuɣ ȓexxu axafi arḍan yiwḏan? Lla, rezzuɣ axafi yarḍa Arebbi! Ma nec rezzuɣ aḏasen ƹejbeɣ i yiwḏan? Lla, maƹlik ƹaḏ rezzuɣ aḏasen ƹejbeɣ i yiwḏan, ataf nec war ǧiɣ ca ḏ axeddam n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siḏna Bulus netta ḏ arrasul n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Fa ay ayṯma, itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tessnem belli Lʼinjil nni iy zi kenniw beccareɣ qa netta war d yusi ca zi bnaḏem. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />War ḏayi d yusi zi ḥadd, war ḏayi ṯ sȓemḏen ca yiwḏan; Lla, netta ihwa-d xafi ḏ lwaḥi zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Aqa ṯesȓim xafi mammec tuɣa tƹiceɣ zi qbeȓ wami tuɣa tbaƹeɣ ddin n Ayṯ-Israʼil, iƹni mammec tuɣa tƹeddabeɣ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi s umenɣi, rezzuɣ axasen qḍiɣ. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Tuɣa nec tgaƹƹaḏeɣ mliḥ ḏi ddin n Ayṯ-Israʼil ƹȓayen qaƹ ḥsen zeg iqrinen inu. Tuɣa nec rezzuɣ aṭṭas aḏ ggeɣ lwajib ƹlaḥsab lƹadaṯ n ȓejḏuḏ inu. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15-16" />Walakin Arebbi zi qbeȓ tuɣa iƹzeȓ-ayi nec iƹni ixḍar-ayi ḏeg uƹeddis n yemma ssenni iȓaɣa-ayi-d s arḍa nnes. Wami xafi yarḍa netta, iseḍhar-ayi-d Mmis ḥima azzayes beccareɣ jar ȓegnus. Ȓexddenni war mcawareɣ ak ḥadd. <verse eid="GAL 1:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />War gaƹƹḏeɣ ca ɣar ṯendint n Lquds bac aḏ ẓreɣ yinni tuɣa iǧan ḏ arrusul qbeȓ i nec. Lla, nec ruḥeɣ nican ɣar ṯmurṯ n waƹraben u ssenni ḏewȓeɣ-d ƹaweḏ ɣar ṯendint n Dimacq.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ṯeƹḏu ijjen ṯeȓt snin gaƹƹḏeɣ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ḥima aḏ ẓreɣ arrasul Buṭrus, qqimeɣ akiḏes ijjen xemmesṭacar yum. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Nec ḏinni war ẓriɣ uȓa ḏ ijjen n arrasul nneɣni ɣir Yaƹqub umas n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Min ḏawem d tariɣ, tariɣ-ṯ-iḏ u Arebbi ixezzar ḏayi war iǧi bu ḏ ixarriqen. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Menbaƹd ruḥeɣ ɣar Surya ḏ lʼiqlim n Kilikya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Tuɣa nec ƹaḏ war ḏayi ssinen ca ḏeg uɣembub inu ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin n Lmasiḥ ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Niṯni ɣir tesȓan xafi qa Bulus nni iy tuɣa ḏaneɣ itƹeddaben zi qbeȓ ȓexxu netta itbeccar s Lʼinjil nni iy xef irezzu aḏ iqḍa. <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ssenni uca ḥemmḏen Arebbi xafi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Arrasul Bulus qebbȓen-ṯ arrusul nneɣni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Wami ṯeƹḏu ijjen arbeƹṭacar sna, gaƹƹḏeɣ ƹaweḏ ɣar ṯendint n Lquds ak Barnaba, uwiɣ akiḏi uȓa ḏ <char style="it">umaṯneɣ</char> Titus. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ƹlaḥsab min zi ḏayi iweṣṣa Arebbi ḏeg yijjen n lwaḥi iy gaƹƹḏeɣ ḏinni sexbareɣ-ṯen x Lʼinjil iy zi tbeccareɣ jar ȓegnus. Walakin ggiɣ manayenni ɣir i yinni iǧan ḏ imeqqranen <char style="it">n jmaƹeṯ</char> ḥima aḏ ssneɣ min xeḏmeɣ ḏ min tuɣa xeddmeɣ war iǧi ca ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Titus iǧan ḏ amƹacar inu, waxxa netta ḏ ayunani war xas zeyyaren ca ḥima aḏ igg ṭṭahareṯ. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Rezzun xas x manayenni can n wawmaṯen zaƹma tbuṣaren waha, uḏfen-d jaraneɣ s ṯnufra ḥima aḏ jesssen x lḥurriya iy ɣarneɣ ḏi Lmasiḥ bac aḏaneɣ arren am isemɣan <char style="it">i ccariƹa nsen</char>. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Walakin neccin nugi aḏasen negg array uȓa ḏ ijjen n dqiqeṯ ḥima aḏ teqqim akiḏwem lḥaqiqa n Lʼinjil.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Amma yinni tɣir-awem ḏ imeqqranen xawem, niṯni war arnin uȓa ḏ ijjen n wawaȓ zi min beccareɣ nec. Qqareɣ manaya, min ma ƹnan yina ɣari kif-kif, iƹni Arebbi war itegg bu s wuḏemawen jaraneɣ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Walakin min ufin? Ufin ikellef-ayi Arebbi bac aḏ beccareɣ i iyunaniyen mammec ikellef Buṭrus bac aḏ ibeccar i Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Minzi Arebbi ig isxeddamen ttebcir n Buṭrus am arrasul i Ayṯ-Israʼil, ḏ netta ig isxeddamen ƹaweḏ ttebcir inu am arrasul i yinni iǧan ḏ iyunaniyen. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yaƹqub ḏ Buṭrus ḏ Yuḥanna itwaḥsabben ḏ imeqqranen ḏi jmaƹeṯ <char style="it">nni</char>, fehmen arḍa iy ḏayi yuca Arebbi seǧmen xaneɣ nec ḏ Barnaba s ufus afusi nsen amƹacar. Qebȓen-aneɣ neccin a nraḥ a nbeccar i yinni iǧan ḏ iyunaniyen, niṯni aḏ beccaren i yinni iǧan zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ɣir ttaren zzayneɣ a nfekkar ḏeg ipubriṯen nsen. Manayenni rezzuɣ-ṯ nniṯ s wuȓ inu aṯ ggeɣ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arrasul Bulus itwajah arrasul Buṭrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Fa wami d yusa Buṭrus ɣar ṯendint n Wanṭakya wajheɣ-ṯ aɣembub ḏeg uɣembub liʼanna igga ijjen n lɣaleṭ. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" /><char style="it">Min iƹna lɣaleṭ nni?</char> Aqa qbeȓ ma aḏ d yas ijjen n ȓḥizeb iƹni can yiwḏan zi Yaƹqub tuɣa Buṭrus itett ak ȓmuminin iǧan ḏ iyunaniyen. Walakin wami d yusa ȓḥizeb nni, ibḏa Buṭrus itbeƹƹaḏ x iyunaniyen nni ineƹzeȓ xasen. Mayemmi? Liʼanna iggweḏ zi ȓḥizeb nni iƹni n ṭṭahareṯ. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ȓexddenni ḏfaren-ṯ ḏi nnifaq nnes israʼiliyen nneɣni iy yumnen. Uȓa ḏ Barnaba s yixef nnes sbeƹƹḏen-ṯ zeg ubriḏ nican ḏi nnifaq-a nsen.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Wami ṯen ẓriɣ war gguren ca nican ƹlaḥsab lḥaqiqa iy iǧan ḏi Lʼinjil, nniɣ-as i Buṭrus zzaṯsen marra: Cek ḏ aʼisraʼili walakin tƹiceḏ amecnaw iyunaniyen, iƹni maci amecnaw aʼisraʼili. Mammec ɣa ṯeggeḏ aḏ tzeyyareḏ x iyunaniyen bac aḏ ƹicen amecnaw israʼiliyen?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S lʼiman u ṣafi iy ɣa nejmen yiwḏan maci s ccariƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Neccin ḏ israʼiliyen zeg wami d nexȓeq, neccin war neǧi ca zi ȓegnus iƹeṣṣan zaƹma. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Innama, nessen belli bnaḏem war itwasemṣȓaḥ ca ak Arebbi iƹni meȓa iṭaƹ i Ccariƹa n Musa; Lla, manaya illa s lʼiman zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. X manaya uȓa ḏ neccin numen zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ bac a nemṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s lʼiman nni iy zi numen, maci s ṭṭaƹa n Ccariƹa n Musa. Liʼanna uȓa ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem war itwamsemṣȓaḥ ca ak Arebbi s ṭṭaƹa n ccariƹa nni.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Fa neccin nrezzu a nemṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s lʼiman zi Lmasiḥ. Meȓa s manaya menbaƹd nufa ixef nneɣ am ȓegnus iƹeṣṣan zaƹma, ma ataf Lmasiḥ itcejjaƹ-aneɣ ɣar ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Lƹaks, nec aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ lƹaṣi meȓa bniɣ ƹaweḏ nniḍam nni aqḏim n ccariƹa iy heḏmeɣ. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ƹlaḥsab Ccariƹa n Musa nettaṯ s yixef nnes, nec mmuṯeɣ zaƹma i <char style="it">ȓeḥkam n</char> Ccariƹa-ya <char style="it">xafi</char> bac aḏ ddareɣ i Arebbi <char style="it">waha</char>. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Twaṣellbeɣ ak Lmasiḥ. Ssa aȓ ṯsawent maci ḏ nec iy ɣa iddaren; Lla, ḏ Lmasiḥ iy ɣa iddaren ḏayi. Ṯuḏarṯ-a iy ddareɣ ȓexxu ḏi ddat inu, aqa ddareɣ-t s lʼiman inu zi Mmis n Arebbi iy ḏayi iḥibben iṣeddeq xafi ixef nnes. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nec ugiɣ aḏ sbeṭṭȓeɣ arḍa n Arebbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 2:21">Cuf, maƹlik bnaḏem imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s Ccariƹa n Musa, ataf immuṯ Lmasiḥ x ȓbaṭeȓ waha.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lʼiman niɣ ccariƹa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />A Ayṯ-Galaṭya, ma ṯbuhȓiyem niɣ? Wi ḏawem iggin ssḥur? Ncerreḥ-awem mliḥ zzaṯ i ṯittawin nwem mammec immuṯ Lmasiḥ x ṣṣalib. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Akenniw sseqsiɣ x yijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ waha. Ma ihwa-d xawem Arruḥ iqeddsen wami ṯṭaƹem i Ccariƹa n Musa? Lla, ihwa-d wami ṯesȓim i <char style="it">Lʼinjil</char> ṯumnem zzayes. <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Ma ṯbuhȓiyem mliḥ niɣ? Kenniw ṯebḏam mliḥ s <char style="it">ṯzemmar n</char> Arruḥ iqeddsen. Ma ṯrezzum ȓexxu aḏ tkemmȓem s ṯzemmar nwem n bnaḏem?! <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Marra min tƹeddbem, ma iruḥ ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ niɣ? Lla, imken maci ḏ ṣṣaḥ! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Iḏen, mammec ḏawem d iticc Arebbi Arruḥ iqeddsen itegg jarawem lmuƹjizaṯ? Wac xmi tṭaƹam i Ccariƹa n Musa? Lla, xmi tesȓam <char style="it">Lʼinjil</char> tamnem zzayes.<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />
    <char style="it">Iqqar Lkitab</char> x Brahim: &lt;Uca yumen Brahim zi Arebbi, ikkar Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ akiḏes s lʼiman nni.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Falihaḏa, fehmeṯ kenniw belli yinni yumnen niṯni ḏ ṯarwa n Brahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Zi qbeȓ ixbar-d Arebbi ḏi Lkitab aḏ ismeṣȓaḥ akiḏes s lʼiman yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Ƹlaḥsab manayenni ibeccar zi qbeȓ Brahim s Lʼinjil inna-as qa aḏ twabarken marra ȓegnus x ssabab nnec. <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />X manayenni yinni yumnen aḏ twabarken ak Brahim iƹni wenni umi qqaren aryaz n lʼiman.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Cuf, marra yinni itƹewwaȓen x ṭṭaƹa n Ccariƹa <char style="it">n Musa</char> twanaƹƹȓen. Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Twanaƹƹȓen marra yinni war ixeddmen ca zi marra ṯimesȓayin iy yurin ḏi ccariƹa war zzaysent teggen ca!&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Maƹruf belli uȓa ḏ ijjen war izemmar aḏ imeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s Ccariƹa n Musa ȓaḥeqqac <char style="it">Lkitab iqqar</char>: &lt;Wenni iǧan nican aḏ iƹic s lʼiman.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Walakin abriḏ n Ccariƹa n Musa war iǧi ca am ubriḏ n lʼiman ȓaḥeqqac <char style="it">ccariƹa tweṣṣa</char>: &lt;Kuȓ ijjen ixeddmen s ȓuṣiyaṯ-a ḏ lqawanin-a itxeṣṣa azzaysen iƹic.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Lmasiḥ ifekk-aneɣ zi nnaƹȓeṯ nni iǧan ḏi ccariƹa wami yarra ixef nnes ḏ ijjen n nnaƹȓeṯ ƹlaḥsab neccin. Ȓaḥeqqac Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Menƹuȓ kuȓ ijjen iy ṯ ɣa sgaƹƹḏen x ṯeḥnact.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />S Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ṯehwa-d lbaraka nni iy zi tuɣa ṯ iwƹeḏ Arebbi i Brahim ṯuweḍ ɣar ȓegnus, ḥima s lʼiman aḏaneɣ immuc Arruh iqeddsen iy zi ḏaneɣ iwƹeḏ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ȓfarq iǧan jar Ccariƹa n Musa ḏ ȓƹaheḏ n Siḏna Brahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ay ayṯma, aḏawem uceɣ ijjen n lmiṯal zi lƹadaṯ nneɣ. Lwaṣiya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lwaṣiya nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n ṯebrat itegg-it ijjen ƹlaḥsab xmi ɣa immeṯ, issawaȓ ḏayes ƹlaḥsab lwaraṯa.</char></note> nettaṯ meȓa ṯura ṯeḍbeƹ, war izemmar ḥadd at isbeṭṭeȓ niɣ aḏayes yarni can n ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Amenni ƹaweḏ <char style="it">ȓƹaheḏ nni iƹni</char> lwuƹud iy ḏas yuca Arebbi i Brahim ḏ wayyaw nnes. <char style="it">Lkitab</char> war iqqar ca &lt;ayyawen nnes&gt;, iƹni aṭṭas iḏsen. Lla, iqqar &lt;ayyaw nnes&gt;, iƹni ijjen n bnaḏem u netta ḏ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="GAL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Fa nec, min rezzuɣ aḏ iniɣ? Iƹni Ccariƹa n Musa ṯusa-d arbeƹmiyya u ṯȓaṯin sna menbaƹd i ȓƹaheḏ-a <char style="it">ak Brahim</char>. Ccariƹa nni war ṯzemmar ca aḏ tesbeṭṭeȓ ȓƹaheḏ-a <char style="it">ak Brahim</char> ig igga Arebbi. Iƹni min iwƹeḏ Arebbi <char style="it">i Brahim</char> war ṯ tarri ca ccariƹa nni ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Cuf, lwareṯ maƹlik iticc-iṯ Arebbi ak Ccariƹa n Musa, ataf war ṯ iticc ca ak ȓƹaheḏ <char style="it">nnes i Brahim</char>. Walakin lla, lwareṯ nni iwƹed-iṯ Arebbi i Brahim s yijjen n ȓƹaheḏ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Iwa, mayemmi teǧa Ccariƹa n Musa baƹḏa? Ccariƹa ṯemmuc nettaṯ bac aḏ issen bnaḏem ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. Tuɣa ṯṣeǧaḥ qbeȓ ma aḏ d yas wayyaw <char style="it">n Brahim</char> iy zi ṯ iwƹeḏ Arebbi. Ccariƹa nni uwint-it lmalaʼikaṯ, ṯumma ijjen n lwasiṭ <char style="it">iƹni Musa</char> issiweḍ-it-id. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Netta ḏ lwasiṭ waha, iƹni war ixeddem ca waḥḏes. Walakin Arebbi netta ig iǧan waḥḏes.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Min ṯeƹna ȓxeḏmeṯ n Ccariƹa n Musa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Iḏen Ccariƹa n Musa, ma tƹarraḍ lwuƹud n Arebbi? Lla walu! Cuf, maƹlik ṯemmuc can ccariƹa iticcen ṯuḏarṯ i bnaḏem, ataf aḏaneɣ ṯarr nican ak Arebbi ccariƹa nni. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Walakin lla, Lkitab iqqar belli marra min iǧan netta amecnaw ameḥbus n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Mayemmi? Bac min iwƹeḏ aḏ immuc s lʼiman zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ i yinni iy ɣa yamnen.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Fa qbeȓ ma aḏ d yas lʼiman-a, tuɣa Ccariƹa n Musa ṯcarref-aneɣ iƹni neccin tuɣa neǧa amecnaw imeḥbas nnes ḥetta aȓ wami iy d imeḍhar lʼiman-a iy tuɣa d itasen. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />S manayenni Ccariƹa n Musa tuɣa trebba-yaneɣ ḥetta aȓ wami d yusa Lmasiḥ u ssenni iy ɣa nmeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s lʼiman. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ȓexxu wami ṣafi imeḍhar-d lʼiman, war ṯeqqim ca Ccariƹa n Musa trebba-yaneɣ.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aqa kenniw marra iḏwem ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi s lʼiman. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Liʼanna kenniw ig itwaṭehharen s waman bac aḏ tiȓim ḏi Lmasiḥ, aqa ṯmunem kenniw ḏ ijjen akiḏes. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />War ḏinni lla aʼisraʼili niɣ ḏ ayunani. War ḏinni lla ismeɣ niɣ ḏ wenni iǧan ḥurr. War ḏinni lla aryaz lla ṯamɣarṯ. Aqa kenniw marra iḏwem ṯmunem ḏ ijjen ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Meȓa kenniw zi Lmasiḥ ataf kenniw ḏ ṯarwa n Brahim ɣarwem lwareṯ nni ƹlaḥsab minzi ṯ iwƹeḏ Siḏi Arebbi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Iwa, min xseɣ aḏawem iniɣ? Wenni iy ɣa iwarṯen can ṯmesȓayṯ netta ƹaḏ ḏ amezyan, itwaḥsab netta am yijjen n yismeɣ waxxa ataf netta ḏ bab n kuȓci. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Iƹni itegg array i wenni iy ṯ itrebban u ḏ wenni iy zzayes itkellafen aȓ ɣa d ṯaweḍ ȓweqṯ nni iy ḏas iḥedd babas. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ammu uȓa ḏ neccin. Wami neǧa ƹaḏ ḏ imezyanen, am isemɣan ḥekkmen xaneɣ lqawanin iqḏimen n ddunect-a. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Walakin wami d ṯuweḍ ȓweqṯ ig izemmem Arebbi, ikkar netta issekk-d Mmis itwaxȓeq-d zeg yijjen n ṯemɣarṯ, itwaxȓeq-d ṯḥekkem xas Ccariƹa n Musa. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Mayemmi? Ḥima aḏ iqeddem lfidya x yinni iy xef ṯḥekkem Ccariƹa n Musa bac aḏaneɣ itbenna Arebbi a niȓi ḏ ṯarwa nnes. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Wami ṯḏewȓem kenniw ḏ ṯarwa n Arebbi, issekk-d Arruḥ n Mmis yuḏef ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ ɣar ḏaxeȓ itȓaɣa iqqar, a Baba a Baba inu! <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />X manaya ȓexxu cek maci ḏ ismeɣ, cek ḏ mmis. Wami cek ḏ mmis, azzayes ṯwarṯeḏ zi Arebbi.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amnus n arrasul Bulus x ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Galaṭya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iƹḏun tuɣa war ṯessinem ca Arebbi, ḥekkmen xawem lʼaṣnam zaƹma, ḏi ṭṭabiƹa nsen niṯni maci ḏ arebbiṯen n ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Walakin ȓexxu kenniw ṯessnem Arebbi, iƹni netta iy kenniw issnen. Mammec teggem ƹaweḏ ṯḏewwaȓem ɣar lqawanin iqḏimen nni iteḍƹifen war itejhiḏen ca? Ma ṯexsem aɣarsen ṯḏewȓem ḏ isemɣan ƹaweḏ niɣ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Aqa kenniw tbaƹem ussan n ddin nsen ḏ ȓechuraṯ ḏ ȓfuṣul ḏ lƹamaṯ nsen! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ggwḏeɣ, imken marra ȓxeḏmeṯ inu akiḏwem ṯiȓi ḏi ȓbaṭeȓ u ṣafi. <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ay ayṯma tzawageɣ-kenniw, iȓiṯ am nec liʼanna nec ƹaweḏ ḏewȓeɣ am kenniw.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 4:12">Kenniw war ḏayi ṯeḍȓimem ca uȓa s yijjen n ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Aqa ṯessnem belli nec tbeccareɣ-kenniw s Lʼinjil ḏ amezwaru ƹlaḥsab ijjen n ȓehȓac ḏ lmaraḍ ḏi ddat inu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ȓehȓac nni inu yuwi-awem-d ijjen n tamara. Waxxa amenni war ḏayi ṯḥeggarem ca war ḏayi ṯseḥqarem ca. Lla, ṯreḥbem zzayi ɣarwem am yijjen zi lmalaʼikaṯ n Arebbi niɣ am Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s yixef nnes. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Iwa, manis ṯekka ȓefraḥeṯ nni tuɣa ɣarwem? Aqa cehhḏeɣ xawem belli maƹlik tuɣa ṯzemmarem, iȓi ṯqeȓƹem-d ṯiṭṭawin nwem ṯucim-ayi-ṯent. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ma ȓexxu nec ḏ ȓƹaḏu nwem wami ḏawem nniɣ lḥaqiqa nican?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Iwḏan-a <char style="it">iseƹƹwajen Lʼinjil, min rezzun?</char> Teggen akiḏwem ȓxir aṭṭas zaƹma walakin ƹlaḥsab aƹeddis nsen imɣaren. Rezzun akenniw kesben bac akenniw sbeƹƹḏen xaneɣ, ṯumma kenniw iy ḏaysen ɣa iggen ȓxir aṭṭas. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Iwa ȓebda ḏ lemliḥ meȓa can yijjen irezzu aḏawem igg ȓxir. Maci ɣir nec iy ɣa iggen manaya waha, walakin labud ssabab n ȓxir-a aḏ yiȓi ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />A ṯarwa inu, kessiɣ xawem ijjen n umnus ƹaweḏ amecnaw ȓeḥriq n ṯarwa ḥetta aȓ d ixȓeq Lmasiḥ ḏaywem! <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Mecḥaȓ tmenniɣ akiḏwem iȓiɣ ȓexxu bac ṣṣut inu war iteqsiḥ ca akiḏwem ammu liʼanna aqayi tƹeddabeɣ s umnus ƹlaḥsab kenniw.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ȓmiṯal x ṯemɣarin n Siḏna Brahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Inim-ayi kenniw itexsen axawem ṯḥekkem Ccariƹa n Musa. Ma war ṯessinem min ḏayes ḏi ccariƹa nni niɣ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Wah, Lkitab iqqar belli Brahim ɣares ṯnayen n ṯarwa nnes, ijjen zi ṯismeɣṯ ijjen zi tenni iy iǧan ḥurr. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Mmis nni iy d yusin zi ṯismeɣṯ ixȓeq-d ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar n bnaḏem waha. Walakin mmis iy d yusin zi ṯenni iy iǧan ḥurr ixȓeq-d ƹlaḥsab minzi iwƹeḏ Arebbi Brahim.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Iƹni manaya ḏayes ȓemƹani. Ṯimɣarin-a niṯenti s ṯnayen ḏaysent ṯnayen n ȓƹuhuḏ. Ijjen n ȓƹaheḏ netta zeg Uḏrar n Sina, itarew ṯarwa ḏ isemɣan. Nettaṯ ḏ Hajar. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Iwa Hajar nettaṯ amecnaw Aḏrar n Sina iy d itasen ḏi ṯmurṯ n waƹraben. Nettaṯ ṯetwaḥsab ḏ ṯandint n Lquds ḏi ȓweqṯ-a liʼanna nettaṯ ḏ ṯarwa nnes ig iǧan ḏ isemɣan. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Walakin ṯandint n Lquds iy iǧan ḏeg ujenna aqat ḥurr, nettaṯ ḏ yemmaṯneɣ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni nettaṯ ḏ Sara ṯamɣarṯ ṯamezwarut n Siḏna Brahim. Nettaṯ ḏ yemmas n Siḏna Isḥaq.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Minzi Lkitab iqqar:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;Ssaƹḏ nnem ya ṯenni war itirwen ca ṯarwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ƹeyyeḍ s ȓefraḥeṯ ya ṯenni war ḏi itiȓi ȓeḥriq n ṯarwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Aqa ṯarwa n ṯenni bȓa aryaz</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">aḏ arnin ktar zi ṯenni ɣar iǧa uryaz.&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Fa ay ayṯma, kenniw ḏ ṯarwa n ȓƹaheḏ amecnaw Isḥaq <char style="it">mmis n Brahim</char>. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni, wenni iy d ixeȓqen ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar waha n bnaḏem itƹeddab <char style="it">Isḥaq iƹni</char> wenni iy d ixeȓqen s jjheḏ n Arruḥ iqeddsen. U manaya kif-kif ḏi ȓweqṯ-a. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Walakin min iqqar Lkitab? &lt;Azzeȓ x ṯismeɣṯ ḏ mmis ȓaḥeqqac mmis n ṯismeɣṯ war itwariṯ ca akeḏ mmis n ṯenni iǧan ḥurr.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ay ayṯma, s manaya war neǧi ca ḏ ṯarwa n ṯismeɣṯ; Lla, neccin ḏ ṯarwa n ṯenni iǧan ḥurr.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Ɣar lḥurriya iḍȓeq-aneɣ-d Lmasiḥ bac a niȓi ḥurr ḏ ṣṣaḥ. Beddeṯ nican baƹda, war tejjaṯ ca axawem ibesseȓ ƹaweḏ ijjen n dqeȓ n ṯzayȓut n isemɣan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni ḏanita arrasul Bulus itcabbah ṯzayȓut n isemɣan ḏi Ccariƹa n Siḏna Musa, ṯbesseȓ x Ayṯ-Israʼil am yijjen n dqeȓ iqseḥ.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lḥurriya n ṣṣaḥ ḏi Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ṣennṭeṯ! Nec ḏ Bulus qqareɣ-awem meȓa ṯeggim ṭṭahareṯ <char style="it">n Musa</char>, ataf Lmasiḥ war kenniw ineffeƹ s walu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Aḏawem ƹawḏeɣ, aḏ iniɣ i kuȓ aryaz wenni iy ɣa iggen ṭṭahareṯ <char style="it">n Musa</char>, itxeṣṣa labud aḏ iṭaƹ i Ccariƹa n Musa amen-ṯekmaȓ. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Kenniw iy irezzun ṣṣulḥ s ccariƹa nni ak Arebbi, aqa ṯetwaḥarrmem zi Lmasiḥ ṯbeƹƹḏem x arḍa nnes. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Qa neccin lla, netraja Arebbi aḏaneɣ isemṣȓaḥ akiḏes s lʼiman, u lʼamal-a nneɣ netta s jjheḏ n Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Liʼanna ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iƹni bnaḏem meȓa igga ṭṭahareṯ niɣ war t iggi ca, manaya war ineffeƹ s walu. Min ineffƹen? Ineffeƹ lʼiman ig ixeddmen ccɣeȓ nnes s ȓemḥibbeṯ.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Tuɣa kenniw ṯeǧam ḏeg yijjen n ubriḏ ɣar zzaṯ mliḥ. Wi kenniw isbedden bac war teggem ca array i lḥaqiqa? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Array-a iy teggem kenniw zaƹma maci zi Arebbi iy ḏawem d itȓaɣan. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Ɣir ḏrus n untun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antun netta ḏ amṯun.</char></note> isgaƹƹaḏ-d marra ȓƹajneṯ n urecṯi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arecṯi iƹni netta ḏ ariyṯi.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nec ɣari ttiqeṯ ḏi Arebbi war ṯqebbȓem bu can n array nneɣni. Walakin wenni iy kenniw isxerwaḍen, min ma iƹna netta aṯ iḥaseb s lƹiqab nnes. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ay ayṯma, nec maƹlik ƹaḏ seȓmaḏeɣ ṭṭahareṯ <char style="it">n Musa</char> zaƹma, iwa mayemmi ƹaḏ ḏayi tƹeddaben niṯni? Maƹlik labud ṭṭahareṯ-a, ataf ṣafi war itiȓi bu uḥeggar n ṣṣalib. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />U yinni iy kenniw iheǧcen <char style="it">x ṭṭahareṯ-a</char> tmenniɣ aḏ raḥen niṯni aḏ qessen ixef nsen!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Cuf ay ayṯma, iȓaɣa-yawem-d Arebbi bac aḏ tiȓim ḥurr. Walakin war tejjaṯ ca lḥurriya-ya nwem aḏ tiȓi ḏ ijjen n ubriḏ iy zi ɣa ṯseƹƹifem ccehweṯ n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem; Lla, aḏ tsexxarem i wayawya s ȓemḥibbeṯ. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Aqa marra ȓuṣiyaṯ n Ccariƹa n Musa munent-iḏ ḏanita: &lt;Aḏ texseḏ ajjar nnec amecnaw ixef nnec.&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Walakin meȓa tmermacem ayawya <char style="it">am ȓuḥuc</char> wa itett wa, ḥḍam ixef nwem aḏ tseɣȓim ayawya.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ ṭṭabiƹa n bnaḏem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Fa nniɣ-awem, tƹiceṯ ƹlaḥsab ȓxaḍar n Arruḥ iqeddsen ṯumma war tseƹƹifem ca ccehawaṯ n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Liʼanna min ṯrezzu ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nneɣ netta ḍed n min irezzu Arruḥ iqeddsen. U amenni min irezzu Arruḥ iqeddsen netta ḍed n min ṯrezzu ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nneɣ. Tƹarraḍen i wayawya ssenni war teggem ca ṯimesȓayin-a iy ṯexsem aḏ teggem. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />U meȓa ȓxaḍar n Arruḥ iqeddsen indeh-ikenniw, ataf war xawem ṯḥekkim ca ccariƹa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ȓexḏayem n ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nneɣ aqa tbanent-id iƹni lfasad ḏ min isexnizen ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />ḏ lƹibada n lʼaṣnam ḏ ssḥur ḏ lƹadawa ḏ umenɣi ḏ lɣira ḏ uɣḍab ḏ lʼananiya ḏ lxilafaṯ ḏ lʼaḥzab, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ḏ ȓeḥseḏ ḏ waṭṭas n ccreb ḏ lmadella n ssekra ḏ min itcabbahen ḏi manaya. Ƹeǧmeɣ-awem-d ȓexxu mamc tuɣa ḏawem ƹeȓmeɣ zi qbeȓ: yinni iteggen ȓexḏayem-a war twariṯen ca ȓmulk n Arebbi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Fa min d itarew Arruḥ iqeddsen? Itarew-d ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ȓehna ḏ ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar ḏ ȓxir ḏ wuȓ acemȓaȓ ḏ bnaḏem ḏi iǧa ttiqeṯ <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ḏ ttawaḍuƹ ḏ bnaḏem iḥekkmen x ccehweṯ nnes. War ṯeǧi bu can n ccariƹa ig isbeddan ṯimesȓayin-a. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />U yinni iǧan n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ṣafi ṣellben ṭṭabiƹa nni ṯaƹeffant nsen ak ccehweṯ ḏ ȓxaḍar n ṭṭabiƹa-ya. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Meȓa netƹic s Arruḥ iqeddsen, ataf labud a nuyur s ȓxaḍar nnes. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />War nsemɣar ca ixef nneɣ s ttakebbur, war ḏayneɣ itiȓi ca ȓeḥseḏ ḏ ṯɣennant jaraneɣ.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ay ayṯma, meȓa ṯufim can yijjen <char style="it">zzaywem</char> ṯseḥṣer-iṯ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, labud meȓa ṯjehḏem kenniw s Arruḥ iqeddsen aṯiḏ tarrem ɣar ubriḏ s yijjen n wuȓ iṣebbaren. U ḥḍa ixef nnec uȓa ḏ cek bac war ṯetwaɣarriḏ ca. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Arbuṯ dqeȓ ag wayawya, s manaya aḏ teggem ȓuṣiyeṯ nni n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Cuf, meȓa can n bnaḏem itfekkar aḏ iftaxar s yixef nnes walakin netta war ḏayes walu, ataf ixeddeƹ ixef nnes. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Lla, labud mkuȓ ijjen aḏ irajeƹ nniṯ ȓexḏayem nnes, ṯumma ataf aḏ iftaxar nican u bȓa ma aḏ icabbeh ixef nnes ḏeg umƹacar nnes. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ȓaḥeqqac mkuȓ ijjen aḏ yarbu ȓeḥmeȓ nnes.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Fa wenni umi seȓmaḏen awaȓ n Arebbi, itxeṣṣa aḏ icarec netta ak wenni iseȓmaḏen zi marra min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />War xeddƹeṯ ca ixef nwem, Arebbi war ṯ icemmeṯ uȓa ḏ ijjen. Iƹni min ma izreƹ bnaḏem, ḏ manayenni iy ɣa imjar. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Wenni iy ɣa izerƹen min ṯexs ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nnes azzayes imjar min ifennan. Wenni iy ɣa izerƹen min ixes Arruḥ iqeddsen azzayes imjar ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Iwa itxeṣṣa war ntiḥeȓ ca ḏi ȓexḏayem n ȓxir. Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac aȓ ȓweqṯ nni nican n umjar a nemjar iƹni meȓa war nefciȓ ca. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Iḏen meȓmi ma nufa lfurṣa, labud a negg ȓxir ḏi marra iwḏan xaṣṣatan ak ayṯmaṯneɣ ḏi lʼiman.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Aqa twaȓam ȓḥuruf-a mecḥaȓ ḏ imeqqranen niṯni, u nec tariɣ-ṯen nniṯ s ufus inu!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Yinni irezzun aḏ ftaxaren zi ddat, <char style="it">iƹni min war iǧin ca zi Arruḥ iqeddsen,</char> niṯni tbessaȓen xawem bac aḏ teggem ṭṭahareṯ <char style="it">n Musa</char>. Mayemmi? Ɣir rezzun niṯni war tƹeddiben ca x ssabab n ṣṣalib n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Cuf, yinni iteggen ṭṭahareṯ niṯni s yixef nsen war tṭiƹin ca i ccariƹa nsen. Rezzun kenniw aḏ teggem ṭṭahareṯ bac aḏ ftaxaren <char style="it">belli ṯeggim lƹada nsen</char> ḏi ddat nwem. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Walakin nec ƹemmarṣ aḏ ftaxareɣ illa zi ṣṣalib n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Zi ṣṣalib nnes iy zi ṯetwaṣelleb ddunect i nec, u zzayes ƹaweḏ nec iy zi twaṣellbeɣ i ddunect. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Liʼanna bnaḏem meȓa igga ṭṭahareṯ niɣ war t iggi ca, manaya war ineffeƹ ca; Lla, ineffeƹ meȓa bnaḏem ixȓeq-d qaƹ ḏ jḏiḏ. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Marra yinni igguren x min tweṣṣiɣ nec ḏi ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ataf aɣarsen yiȓi ȓehna ḏ arraḥmeṯ ak ccaƹb n Arebbi.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ssa aȓ ṯsawent itxeṣṣa war ḏayi itegg ḥadd tamara ȓaḥeqqac ddat inu ḏayes lʼaṯar n Ƹisa.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ay ayṯma, aḏ yiȓi ak arruḥ nwem arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Amin.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>